---
description: Graph adapter conventions
globs: packages/graph/**,packages/evidence/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Every adapter returns Evidence[] matching packages/shared/types.ts.
Adapter A = live transfer/activity subgraph. Adapter B = a real Messari Standardized
Subgraph, not a bespoke schema (required for Graph Composable track qualification).
Data-fetching and AI interpretation never live in the same function.
Fixtures only under /evals, named *.fixture.ts.
